{
  "bookId": "rewind-26",
  "id": "chapter-105",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "25018001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "来人，把她们给我带过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天启精英甲",
          "text": "——报，两人均已带到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "无论对「天启」还是对「七星阁」来说，你都彻底暴露了。\n与其抓我，想办法自保才是最明智的，你说呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "你不过是个小小的棋子而已，能知道些什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "可是真正和你对弈的那位大人，才华与谋略都绝不会在你之下哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "你要知道，天下之事无论大小，都逃不过那位大人的眼睛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "所以，我很期待你被那位大人抓走接受「七星阁」审判的狼狈模样，内鬼先生。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "闭嘴，少故弄玄虚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "给我狠狠地教训她们，直到她们说出「七星古镜」的下落。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天启精英甲",
          "text": "领命！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "天启精英乙",
          "text": "杀！杀！杀！——毁掉！毁掉！毁掉！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "你的伤还没好，我负责掩护，你便趁机逃走吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "开什么玩笑，我孙尚香什么时候需要你来保护了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25018014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "——闪开，这群家伙我来摆平。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-577",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "thebeauty",
          "rowIds": [
            25018001,
            25018002,
            25018003,
            25018004,
            25018005,
